{"title": "Dark Vengeance", "pageid": 28935, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dark_Vengeance", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dark_Devotion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Dark_Devotion.webp/300px-Dark_Devotion.webp, /w/images/9/93/Dark_Devotion.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Dark_Devotion.webp/300px-Dark_Devotion.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/Dark_Devotion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>This feature gives the character <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">advantage</a> against targets standing in <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\">Darkness</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The Justiciar has advantage against targets standing in darkness. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Justiciar_Crusader\" title=\"Justiciar Crusader\">Justiciar Crusader</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nightmist\" title=\"Nightmist\">Nightmist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Owltalon\" title=\"Owltalon\">Owltalon</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202246\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 451/1000000\nPost‐expand inc